title: Fortios: Managed switch health summary
agents: special
catalog: network/fortigate
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the overall health summary of connected switches of a Fortigate firewall.
 It evaluates the rating of each component reported by the FortiOS health-status API endpoint,
 including CPU, Memory, Temperature, PoE, Fan(s) and PSU(s).

 The check state is derived from the worst component rating:
 "good" results in OK, "warning" in WARN, any other value (e.g. "critical") in CRIT.

 This check is only available on FortiOS 7.4 and later, as the health-status API endpoint
 providing the summary data was introduced in that version.

 This check receives its data via a piggyback mechanism.

 The special agent is required for this check,
 which can be configured via "FortiOS".

discovery:
 One service per switch is created, provided summary data is available (FortiOS 7.4+).
